1049
00:57:51,509 --> 00:57:54,512
[Jo] Dad! Uncle, help! Hurry up!

1050
00:57:59,142 --> 00:58:01,686
-We're gonna take you to a doctor.
-[Paz] No, it's a bad idea.

1051
00:58:01,769 --> 00:58:03,897
-You're going to a doctor.
-…

1052
00:58:03,980 --> 00:58:06,191
-You need to see a doctor.
-[Paz] My wig! Matti! …

1053
00:58:06,274 --> 00:58:07,442
[Matti] I have it. I have it.

1054
00:58:08,234 --> 00:58:09,110
Your bag!

1055
00:58:12,530 --> 00:58:17,118
We can do a biopsy to confirm everything
and see if it has metastasized,

1056
00:58:17,744 --> 00:58:19,954
