1060
00:58:27,795 --> 00:58:29,923
It's my life, my decision.

1061
00:58:39,224 --> 00:58:40,141
Sorry, Doc.

1062
00:58:42,810 --> 00:58:44,479
Mom, what if something happens to you?

1063
00:58:45,563 --> 00:58:48,107
