1064
00:58:51,194 --> 00:58:54,781
Why don't we just trust the diagnosis
of the experts in New York?

1065
00:58:54,864 --> 00:58:57,242
It's right there in front of you.
Just read it.

1066
00:58:59,160 --> 00:59:02,163
And I'm not going to pay this woman
with a man's name

1067
00:59:02,247 --> 00:59:05,500
any more money
to learn something I already know.

1068
00:59:10,004 --> 00:59:11,172
Hey.

1069
00:59:11,256 --> 00:59:12,298
[Doctor] Actually, ma'am,

1070
00:59:13,174 --> 00:59:16,928
we have treatments here that have helped
a lot of patients like her.

1071
00:59:18,846 --> 00:59:21,182
-Cases of remission in the last stages--
-Ugh.

1072
00:59:22,016 --> 00:59:24,644
Remission, my foot. Are you stupid?

1073
00:59:25,770 --> 00:59:26,771
Ugh.

1074
00:59:26,854 --> 00:59:29,899
Ugh. And I did not leave
everything behind in New York

1075
00:59:29,983 --> 00:59:32,360
just to rot in a hospital like this.

1076
00:59:32,443 --> 00:59:33,820
Are you fucking kidding me?

1077
00:59:41,244 --> 00:59:42,161
Sorry, Doc.

1078
00:59:48,626 --> 00:59:49,627
Um…

1079
00:59:51,170 --> 00:59:54,299
-Doc, can I ask you…
-What is it?

1080
00:59:54,382 --> 00:59:55,300
How long has she got?

1081
00:59:57,218 --> 00:59:59,012
I don't have the whole picture,

1082
00:59:59,804 --> 01:00:03,182
but like I said earlier, some cases…

1083
01:00:07,604 --> 01:00:08,980
Based on this,

1084
01:00:11,316 --> 01:00:12,734
maybe three to six months.

1085
01:00:18,114 --> 01:00:19,115
What do we do now?

1086
01:00:21,284 --> 01:00:22,910
You're in the provinces, is that right?

1087
01:00:22,994 --> 01:00:25,496
-Mmm-hmm.
-She can go into hospice care.

1088
01:00:26,789 --> 01:00:28,249
I don't think we have the money.

1089
01:00:30,043 --> 01:00:32,754
Then you're going to
have to take care of her yourself.

1090
01:00:39,927 --> 01:00:41,304
The total amount's just here.

1091
01:01:01,282 --> 01:01:02,283
Oh.

1092
01:01:02,367 --> 01:01:03,284
Eat up.

1093
01:01:09,415 --> 01:01:10,458
Have something.

1094
01:01:12,502 --> 01:01:13,378
Eat.

1095
01:01:19,008 --> 01:01:20,426
Hmm. Hmm.

1096
01:01:30,728 --> 01:01:31,979
[retches]

1097
01:01:32,063 --> 01:01:34,315
Tissue. Tissue, please.

1098
01:01:36,776 --> 01:01:38,277
[Rene] Uh, drink… Drink some water.

1099
01:01:38,986 --> 01:01:40,363
Oh, I'm sorry.

1100
01:01:42,240 --> 01:01:43,700
I can't. I'm sorry.

1101
01:01:46,369 --> 01:01:47,453
Mattias.

1102
01:01:47,537 --> 01:01:48,579
What is it this time?

1103
01:01:49,288 --> 01:01:52,291
I'm sorry. I'm sorry,
but, Mom, you love this stuff.

1104
01:01:52,375 --> 01:01:54,085
Even in New York, you eat this stuff.

1105
01:01:54,168 --> 01:01:56,421
And it's fucking loaded
with pork fat and chemicals,

1106
01:01:56,504 --> 01:01:58,047
but you still eat it anyway.

1107
01:01:58,131 --> 01:01:59,924
When I was little,
you'd force-feed it to me,

1108
01:02:00,007 --> 01:02:03,469
I pretended to like it for you, so why
can't you pretend to like it for me now?

1109
01:02:08,808 --> 01:02:10,351
You haven't eaten in days.

1110
01:02:10,435 --> 01:02:13,062
And if you don't eat,
you're gonna keep getting skinnier,

1111
01:02:13,146 --> 01:02:14,522
and you're already super skinny,

1112
01:02:15,565 --> 01:02:18,025
-and you're just gonna fucking…
-Mattias.

1113
01:02:18,860 --> 01:02:19,986
Look at me. Look at me.

1114
01:02:21,028 --> 01:02:23,030
I am going to die. Huh?

1115
01:02:25,825 --> 01:02:27,034
[sobbing softly]

1116
01:02:39,172 --> 01:02:41,883
