1117
01:02:53,227 --> 01:02:56,272
[Jo] "My mother has cancer."

1118
01:03:57,291 --> 01:03:59,710
[Jo] Aunt, thank you.
Thank you so much.

1119
01:03:59,794 --> 01:04:01,337
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

1120
01:04:01,420 --> 01:04:03,297
Don't mention it. Anytime.

1121
01:04:03,381 --> 01:04:04,799
Anything I can do to help.

1122
01:04:06,217 --> 01:04:07,885
If you need anything at all,

1123
01:04:07,969 --> 01:04:09,887
-just let me know, okay?
-Mmm-hmm.

1124
01:04:11,639 --> 01:04:13,599
You're a very good daughter.

1125
01:04:18,437 --> 01:04:20,106
Can I ask you something?

1126
01:04:20,189 --> 01:04:21,148
Of course.

1127
01:04:22,650 --> 01:04:24,527
Why are you so kind to her?

1128
01:04:26,571 --> 01:04:28,739
Well, because I know she's like that.

1129
01:04:31,033 --> 01:04:31,868
You know, your mom,

1130
01:04:33,703 --> 01:04:35,246
she hasn't found life easy.

1131
01:04:48,092 --> 01:04:48,968
Uh…

1132
01:04:49,510 --> 01:04:53,973
You know, your mom and I,
we go a long way back.

1133
01:04:54,807 --> 01:04:57,602
So there is this one project
we did together.

1134
01:04:57,685 --> 01:05:00,104
We were playing go-go dancers.
We were prostitutes.

1135
01:05:00,938 --> 01:05:05,818
Unfortunately, we had this completely
abusive prick as our AD.

1136
01:05:06,444 --> 01:05:07,862
And for some reason,

1137
01:05:08,779 --> 01:05:14,035
every time I had a costume change,
over would come this AD into my tent.

1138
01:05:15,369 --> 01:05:16,495
You know what happened?

1139
01:05:17,413 --> 01:05:19,332
He finally groped me,

1140
01:05:20,416 --> 01:05:23,502
and your mom walks into my tent,
she saw it,

1141
01:05:23,586 --> 01:05:28,299
and of course, she picked up a chair
and threw it at the AD.

1142
01:05:28,382 --> 01:05:31,427
She was so livid,
her eyes, they were on fire.

1143
01:05:32,470 --> 01:05:36,474
So, you see, your mom,
she stands up for what's right.

1144
01:05:38,267 --> 01:05:42,897
And with Paz,
what she feels is what you get.

1145
01:05:44,857 --> 01:05:48,069
That's why she's so unpopular.
A lot of people dislike her for it.

1146
01:05:50,404 --> 01:05:53,199
But at least she's not plastic.

1147
01:05:58,204 --> 01:05:59,205
It's just her temper.

1148
01:06:00,122 --> 01:06:02,249
It's scary if she gets a little mad.

1149
01:06:03,125 --> 01:06:05,336
I hope you didn't get that from your mom.

1150
01:06:17,890 --> 01:06:19,976
Miguel, what's that?

1151
01:06:22,520 --> 01:06:24,146
Take it upstairs, will you?

1152
01:06:29,318 --> 01:06:31,070
-Medical supplies.
-For whom?

1153
01:06:31,946 --> 01:06:36,325
I got you Tramadol, morphine.

1154
01:06:36,909 --> 01:06:38,411
There's quite a lot of it there.

1155
01:06:39,578 --> 01:06:40,705
How did you get these?

1156
01:06:40,788 --> 01:06:42,581
The oxygen tank's upstairs.

1157
01:06:43,499 --> 01:06:45,376
Just in case you have trouble breathing.

1158
01:06:46,043 --> 01:06:49,005
I have cancer of the liver, not lungs.

1159
01:06:53,175 --> 01:06:54,093
Joanne.

1160
01:06:55,052 --> 01:06:56,178
Answer me.

1161
01:06:56,262 --> 01:06:57,805
How did you pay for this?

1162
01:06:59,515 --> 01:07:00,933
Joanne, I'm talking to you.

1163
