1172
01:07:24,915 --> 01:07:26,542
Be grateful there's help around.

1173
01:07:26,625 --> 01:07:27,877
I did not ask for help.

1174
01:07:27,960 --> 01:07:29,837
You'll need it before too long.

1175
01:07:31,964 --> 01:07:32,882
You know what?

1176
01:07:33,591 --> 01:07:34,842
I'm not gonna use this shit.

1177
01:07:35,426 --> 01:07:36,302
Just give it back.

1178
01:07:36,385 --> 01:07:37,845
I don't care!

1179
01:07:49,273 --> 01:07:50,274
I'll deal with this.

1180
01:07:51,484 --> 01:07:53,569
-No, let me. I'll do it.
-It's fine.

1181
01:07:56,197 --> 01:07:57,239
