1182
01:07:57,323 --> 01:07:59,033
No, no, let me do it.

1183
01:08:00,326 --> 01:08:01,994
Leave it. It's okay.

1184
01:08:23,557 --> 01:08:25,518
Go on. They might leave without you.

1185
01:08:51,127 --> 01:08:52,795
[ship horn honks]

1186
01:09:10,855 --> 01:09:15,943
[Jo] Sequence 20. Legais sitting
on the bed, staring at the ceiling.

1187
01:09:16,569 --> 01:09:18,654
The wind outside is howling,

1188
01:09:19,655 --> 01:09:22,032
so there is a banging on the wall.

1189
01:09:22,950 --> 01:09:27,955
but the banging starts
to sound like a knocking.

