1193
01:09:40,009 --> 01:09:41,635
-heads towards the door--
-[Matti] Boom!

1194
01:09:41,719 --> 01:09:42,928
-[screams]
-[laughs]

1195
01:09:45,598 --> 01:09:46,473
Sorry.

1196
01:09:47,308 --> 01:09:49,059
I just wanted to thank you.

1197
01:09:51,770 --> 01:09:52,646
For what?

1198
01:09:53,606 --> 01:09:54,523
For saving me.

1199
01:09:59,653 --> 01:10:00,738
I'm busy.

1200
01:10:00,821 --> 01:10:01,655
I'll be quiet.

1201
01:10:05,492 --> 01:10:07,036
So how are you holding up?

1202
01:10:08,329 --> 01:10:09,580
You said you'd be quiet.

1203
01:10:19,006 --> 01:10:20,507
What are you, um, writing?

1204
01:10:21,383 --> 01:10:22,635
-A movie?
-Mmm-hmm.

1205
01:10:23,260 --> 01:10:24,136
Nice.

1206
01:10:25,679 --> 01:10:26,680
So, what's your story?

1207
01:10:28,224 --> 01:10:29,725
-What, of the movie?
-Yeah.

1208
01:10:31,518 --> 01:10:32,561
[Jo] Uh…

1209
01:10:34,230 --> 01:10:35,940
It's about a girl

1210
01:10:37,441 --> 01:10:40,152
grieving the death of a beloved brother,

1211
01:10:40,945 --> 01:10:44,907
and she's on a quest
to speak to his ghost.

1212
01:10:46,408 --> 01:10:48,661
-How?
-An amulet.

1213
01:10:49,662 --> 01:10:50,621
It's an amulet

1214
01:10:51,872 --> 01:10:54,333
that gives her the power
to speak to the dead.

1215
01:10:55,793 --> 01:10:58,671
And then… [groans]

1216
01:11:01,006 --> 01:11:02,007
I'm stuck.

1217
01:11:07,054 --> 01:11:07,972
[Matti] Let me think.

1218
01:11:10,975 --> 01:11:11,892
What if

1219
01:11:13,477 --> 01:11:15,271
