1223
01:11:46,176 --> 01:11:47,219
Where'd you get the hair?

1224
01:11:48,929 --> 01:11:50,055
My dad.

1225
01:11:50,139 --> 01:11:51,181
Who's your dad?

1226
01:11:57,521 --> 01:11:58,939
Are you still studying?

1227
01:11:59,023 --> 01:12:01,900
-Huh?
