1229
01:12:04,903 --> 01:12:06,071
I finished 12th grade,

1230
01:12:07,531 --> 01:12:09,450
and Mom told me to take a break.

1231
01:12:11,535 --> 01:12:13,954
-And I haven't gone back since.
-[Jo] Mmm.

1232
01:12:16,915 --> 01:12:17,833
Why?

1233
01:12:18,417 --> 01:12:19,418
My moods, I guess.

1234
01:12:20,586 --> 01:12:21,503
Bad grades.

1235
01:12:24,506 --> 01:12:26,467
-Watch out!
-[screams]

1236
01:12:26,550 --> 01:12:27,551
[Matti laughs]

1237
01:12:28,427 --> 01:12:29,345
What's going on?

1238
01:12:30,095 --> 01:12:30,929
Nothing.

1239
01:12:33,015 --> 01:12:34,975
-Why do that?
-[mimicking mockingly] Why do that?

1240
01:12:38,854 --> 01:12:39,772
[Matti] Is it deep?

1241
01:12:40,814 --> 01:12:42,232
[Jo] Um, no.

1242
01:12:43,442 --> 01:12:46,362
I swam here all the time
when I was a little girl.

1243
01:12:47,529 --> 01:12:49,323
[Matti] You're still little. Come on.

1244
01:12:52,576 --> 01:12:53,494
